			"notes": "### Items Displayed\n*Release v1.3 for Minecraft 1.21.1*\n* Added Jewelry Pillow; it can be used to display gems and crystals, and it exists in all 16 vanilla colors\n* Added all Music Discs; they can be placed on ground, or put on Item Display\n* Added Disc Fragment 5, which can be stacked up to 9 pieces in one block\n* Added Flow, Guster, Scrape pottery sherds\n* Added Flow, Bolt smithing templates\n* Added Bricks, Nether Bricks, Amethyst Shards, Echo Shards, Coal, Charcoal\n* Minor translation changes\n* Fixed some bugs\n\n_Small note: due to some changes in data storage, old Item Displays in your world will reset their rotation to 0. Sorry about that, this is just a one-time thing!_"
		},
